<section id="purchases-view" hidden aria-labelledby="purchases-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><h1 id="purchases-title">Compras</h1><p>Registra lo que pides y recibe la mercancía cuando llegue.</p></div><div class="form-actions catalog-actions"><button id="purchase-suppliers" type="button" class="secondary">Proveedores</button><button id="purchase-new" type="button" class="primary">Crear compra</button></div></div>
    <p id="purchase-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <div id="purchase-list-panel"><div class="filters"><div><label for="purchase-search">Buscar compra</label><input id="purchase-search" type="search" placeholder="Folio, proveedor o factura"></div><div><label for="purchase-status-filter">Estado</label><select id="purchase-status-filter"><option value="">Todos</option><option value="borrador">Borradores</option><option value="pedida">Pedidas</option><option value="recibida">Recibidas</option><option value="cancelada">Canceladas</option></select></div></div><p id="purchase-count" class="hint"></p><div class="table-scroll"><table class="purchases-table"><thead><tr><th>Folio / fecha</th><th>Proveedor</th><th>Destino</th><th>Total</th><th>Estado</th><th><span class="sr-only">Acciones</span></th></tr></thead><tbody id="purchase-rows"></tbody></table></div><p id="purchase-empty" hidden>No hay compras para estos filtros. Comienza registrando un proveedor y creando tu primera compra.</p></div>
    <section id="purchase-editor" class="catalog-editor" hidden aria-labelledby="purchase-editor-title"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="purchase-editor-title">Crear compra</h2><button id="purchase-editor-back" type="button" class="secondary">Volver a compras</button></div><form id="purchase-form"><fieldset id="purchase-fields" class="adjust-fields"><div class="product-fields">
        <div><label for="purchase-supplier">Proveedor</label><select id="purchase-supplier" name="proveedor_id" required></select></div><div><label for="purchase-location">Ubicación de destino</label><select id="purchase-location" name="ubicacion_id" required></select></div>
        <div><label for="purchase-payment-condition">Condición de pago</label><select id="purchase-payment-condition" name="condicion_pago"><option value="sin_definir">Por definir / conciliar después</option><option value="contado">Contado</option><option value="credito">Crédito con el proveedor</option></select><p class="hint">Se registra el saldo al recibir. Elegir contado no retira efectivo ni marca la compra como pagada.</p></div><div><label for="purchase-payment-due">Vencimiento de la compra a crédito</label><input id="purchase-payment-due" name="vence" type="date" min="2023-01-01"></div><div><label for="purchase-invoice">Factura o referencia del proveedor</label><input id="purchase-invoice" name="factura_proveedor" maxlength="60"></div><div><label for="purchase-status">Guardar como</label><select id="purchase-status" name="estatus"><option value="borrador">Borrador</option><option value="pedida">Pedida</option></select></div>
        <div class="full-width"><label for="purchase-notes">Notas</label><textarea id="purchase-notes" name="notas" maxlength="500" rows="2"></textarea></div></div>
        <div class="section-heading variants-heading"><div><h2>Mercancía de la compra</h2><p class="hint">Cantidades en unidad base. Costos sin IVA. Recibir la compra no cambia tus precios de venta.</p></div><button id="purchase-add-line" type="button" class="secondary">Agregar producto</button></div><div id="purchase-lines"></div>
        <div class="purchase-totals"><dl><div><dt>Subtotal</dt><dd id="purchase-preview-subtotal">$0.00</dd></div><div><dt>Impuestos</dt><dd id="purchase-preview-tax">$0.00</dd></div><div><dt>Total estimado</dt><dd id="purchase-preview-total">$0.00</dd></div></dl><p class="hint">El servidor calcula y guarda los importes definitivos por renglón.</p></div></fieldset>
        <p class="hint">Guardar no mueve inventario. Después abre la compra y elige Recibir mercancía.</p><p id="purchase-error" class="message" role="alert"></p><div class="form-actions"><button id="purchase-save" class="primary" type="submit">Guardar compra</button><button id="purchase-discard" class="secondary" type="button">Cancelar</button></div></form></section>
    <section id="purchase-detail" class="catalog-editor" hidden aria-labelledby="purchase-detail-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="purchase-detail-title"></h2><p id="purchase-detail-meta" class="hint"></p></div><button id="purchase-detail-back" class="secondary" type="button">Volver a compras</button></div><p id="purchase-detail-reference"></p><div class="table-scroll"><table class="purchase-detail-table"><thead><tr><th>Producto / SKU</th><th>Cantidad</th><th>Costo sin IVA</th><th>Impuesto</th><th>Total del renglón</th></tr></thead><tbody id="purchase-detail-rows"></tbody></table></div><div class="purchase-totals"><dl><div><dt>Subtotal</dt><dd id="purchase-detail-subtotal"></dd></div><div><dt>Impuestos</dt><dd id="purchase-detail-tax"></dd></div><div><dt>Total</dt><dd id="purchase-detail-total"></dd></div></dl></div><p id="purchase-detail-payment" class="hint"></p><button id="purchase-payable" data-icon="wallet" class="secondary" type="button" hidden>Ver cuenta por pagar</button><p id="purchase-detail-notes"></p><p id="purchase-detail-status" class="hint"></p><div class="form-actions"><button id="purchase-edit" class="secondary" type="button">Editar compra</button><button id="purchase-receive" class="primary" type="button">Recibir mercancía</button><button id="purchase-cancel-order" class="secondary" type="button">Cancelar compra</button></div><section id="purchase-action-panel" class="purchase-action" hidden aria-labelledby="purchase-action-title"><h3 id="purchase-action-title"></h3><p id="purchase-action-description"></p><p id="purchase-action-error" class="message" role="alert"></p><div class="form-actions"><button id="purchase-action-confirm" class="primary" type="button">Confirmar recepción</button><button id="purchase-action-dismiss" class="secondary" type="button">Volver sin cambios</button></div></section></section>
    <section id="suppliers-panel" class="catalog-editor" hidden aria-labelledby="suppliers-title"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="suppliers-title">Proveedores</h2><button id="suppliers-back" class="secondary" type="button">Volver a compras</button></div><div class="category-layout"><div><label for="supplier-search">Buscar proveedor</label><input id="supplier-search" type="search" placeholder="Nombre, contacto o teléfono"><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Proveedor</th><th>Estado</th><th><span class="sr-only">Acciones</span></th></tr></thead><tbody id="supplier-rows"></tbody></table></div><p id="suppliers-empty" hidden>No hay proveedores registrados.</p></div><form id="supplier-form"><h3 id="supplier-editor-title">Crear proveedor</h3><label for="supplier-name">Nombre</label><input id="supplier-name" name="nombre" maxlength="200" required><label for="supplier-contact">Contacto</label><input id="supplier-contact" name="contacto" maxlength="150"><label for="supplier-phone">Teléfono</label><input id="supplier-phone" name="telefono" type="tel" maxlength="30"><label for="supplier-email">Correo</label><input id="supplier-email" name="correo" type="email" maxlength="150"><label for="supplier-address">Dirección</label><input id="supplier-address" name="direccion" maxlength="300"><label for="supplier-notes">Notas</label><textarea id="supplier-notes" name="notas" maxlength="500" rows="2"></textarea><label for="supplier-active">Estado</label><select id="supplier-active" name="activo"><option value="1">Activo</option><option value="0">Inactivo</option></select><p id="supplier-error" class="message" role="alert"></p><div class="form-actions"><button id="supplier-save" class="primary" type="submit">Guardar proveedor</button><button id="supplier-new" class="secondary" type="button">Nuevo</button></div></form></div></section>
</section>
